qgfUiHSPLRj0ESgZ2ludSi-SqAcdxU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyG6Lh0kJfPbYbehFMs_RMEdFMnGCRf044CcHbjdwwMVA&oe=69B69F29"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "1066987590342075", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162704_1933786526834081_831610538722066432_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ULJJNxSmy5MQ7kNvwFgTD08&_nc_oc=AdmfhsN8_F7bEtiHfz5UAJV_t5oMcbwIxq0pbFOSmuP624LHXV39V4xPYpYu0buBA9s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyBlHpTVP58KvPM0s66MT40-iQKP8EkCvk3znuad0SJdQ&oe=69B69D14"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Appility", "keywords": ["appility", "accessibility", "disability", "orange", "VR"], "long_description": "What if you were to put yourself in a disabled person\u2019s shoes?\n\nAppility by Orange is an App that allows you to experience common situations encountered in the workplace by people with disabilities: impassable stairs, out-of-reach objects, etc.\n\nAppility by Orange transports you to a virtual reality offering a 360\u00b0 vision, and changes your point of view on disabilities.\nAnswer simple questions to keep the game going.\nUse a Google Cardboard virtual reality headset for an optimal experience.\nYou can also enjoy Appility without a headset, using the panoramic mode.\nAvailable languages: Arabic, Dutch, English, French, Polish,  Romanian, Russian, Slovak, Spanish, Portuguese.", "short_description": "Appility allows you to experience in VR situations encountered at work by people with disabilities"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bienvivreledigital.orange.fr/autonomie", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://bienvivreledigital.orange.fr/autonomie", "publisher_name": "Orange SA", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bienvivreledigital.orange.fr/autonomie", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category":